 * 3. Replace ${componentVarName} / ${dependencyVarName} with field names
 * 4. Fill in the test bodies
 *
 * Notes:
 * - @Mock alone is invisible to the extension; it must sit next to @TestComponent so the mock
 *   replaces the node in the application graph.
 * - Do NOT add @ExtendWith(MockitoExtension.class) — @KoraAppTest already creates, injects,
 *   resets and strictness-checks the mocks.
 * - @MockitoStrictness lives in io.koraframework.test.extension.junit5.mockito. Without it the
 *   level is Strictness.WARN. Valid values: LENIENT, WARN, STRICT_STUBS.
 * - This test has no KoraAppTestConfigModifier, so the real application.conf is used as-is.
